    "body": "Merge note. Class: clean independent review (high tier) with a local build at head `2b191355a` on main `33685374f`, plus a second trial merge on main `dac6a896b` (merge commit `757dbb4dc`, no conflict) because PR #3708 changed the same tool after the review.\n\n- Second trial: `xtask` tests 315 pass, 1 fail. The failed test is `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app`: \"suites without a Gate map: [\\\"sinumerik_810m_post\\\"]\". That file came to main with PR #3317. This PR changes no file under `crates/app/tests`; the red step is on main, not here.\n- clippy `-D warnings`: clean. The quick, batch and release dry runs print a plan. The release plan has 99 heavy steps (273 before): 174 dropped, none added. The independent check of the review: none of the 174 dropped suites has an ignored test in a Rust source, and each of the 49 files with `#[ignore` keeps its heavy step.\n- The open items of the review are #3711.\n- This is a process PR: the `PROCESS_VERSION` bump follows.\n\nThe PR is flagged ready for the merge. Nothing is pushed after this flag.\n",
